"P1188525574" "Parchment"
// DetailString :
"P1399212309" "The scroll of parchment bears the handwriting of Senator Aquila, its contents, an informal introduction to Marcus Valerius:<br><br><color pink><i>Hail, Marcus.  <br><br>Please allow me to introduce to you this traveler who has performed a kind service to me and this fort.  This warrior has listened to the tale of the citizens of Cimerora who are loyal to Imperious and, I believe, may be of great service to you in your battle against Romulus Augustus.<br><br>Your friend and humble servant, <br><br>Decimus Aquila.</color></i>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P708800585" "You will soon come across <color orange>Marcus Valerius</color>, {HeroName}.  He was the Captain of the Guard to Imperious, the former ruler of Cimerora.  Marcus is a steadfast soldier who is fully devoted to Imperious as, of course, all of us who remain in this small fort are.  He has seen many battles and lost many friends in the war against Romulus Augustus.  His manner is brusque, but do not let that fool you.  He has shed as many tears as drops of blood on the battlefield and would have gladly stood in the place of the men who have fallen before him.<br><br>I feel confident that, somehow, you will prove to be a great military asset to Marcus."
// AcceptString :
"P4097705979" "Talk to Marcus Valerius"
// SendOffString :
"P2464065063" "Here.  Take this letter and give it to Marcus. He will be glad of any help, and though an introduction is unnecessary, I believe that these small acts of formality give him a sense of structure that I think pleases him.  These are dark days, {Hero}, so any comfort I can provide, I will do so."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P505470829" "You must speak to Marcus Valerius quickly.  Those dogs who gather around the heels of Romulus have begun to gather openly in this fort.  There is no telling how long before they will try to overtake it as well."
// RequiresFailedText :
"P428463972" "We have not yet been properly introduced, welp.  Do not darken my path unless you have specific business with me."
// TaskTitle :
"P512020173" "<color deepskyblue>A Tale of Cimerora</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3368362153" "<color deepskyblue>Epilogue</color>"

